# ouroboros#156: `what is s at L` through a spliced module call. Line 4
# names no statement in this file or in _am156.eigs. Measured: the v0.43.0
# VM answered seed!!!; the #1361 candidate runtime (c9a478e) answers null.
# The AOT matches main since #1361 round 5, which restores the caller's
# line after every compiled call (AOT_RESTAMP); before that it answered
# seed!!!. Line 4 must stay a comment line for `at 4` to mean this.
import _am156
s is "seed"
s is _am156.tag of s
s is _am156.tag of s
s is _am156.tag of s
print of (what is s at 4)
print of (prev of s)
